Improved circuit logic harness with:
1. Explicit intermediate value tracing + topology consistency checking
2. Confidence-weighted voting with outlier rejection
3. Targeted retry feedback on inverter/junction errors

Addresses all three diagnosis proposals from H002_d:
- Proposal 1: Layer-by-layer value tracing + consistency verification
- Proposal 2: Confidence scoring + filtered aggregation
- Proposal 3: Targeted wire/inverter feedback on retries
"""

